POSIX header files

IPW requires the following POSIX header files:

	limits.h
	unistd.h

If your system already has a limits.h, copy or [symbolically] link it to this
directory -- IPW WON'T find it unless it's here.

Preconfigured versions of <limits.h> for various existing IPW hosts may be
found in the subdirectory "conf".  See the README file therein.

unistd.h is portable, so the implementation given here may be used in any
environment.

